; HashSink branch 3 (VarRef k) -- the branch ctl_model_checking.mm2 uses as the
; EG fixpoint termination test.  <source> backrefs the template's NewVar, so the
; 16-byte big-endian pathmap Catamorphism hash (u128, gxhash) of the SUBTRIE of
; collected <value>s is spliced into the template with substitute_one_de_bruijn.
; upstream expected: (h <16 raw bytes>) -- a SymbolSize(16) literal.
(s 1)
(s 2)
(exec 0 (, (s $x)) (O (hash (h $v) $v $x)))
